ull,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/107681","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/107681","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/107681.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/107681.patch","merged_at":"2025-08-12T16:55:06Z"},"body":"The export option was removed in https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/106359 to support 16kib page size coming in Android 16.\r\n\r\nWe're adding it back to provide devs not targeting the Google Play store and/or Android 16 the ability to reduce their apk size if desired.\r\nInstead, we'll provide a warning (after consulting with Google) to mention the option may be incompatible with Android 16 devices with 16kib page size.\r\n\r\nKeeping the PR in draft for now until we're able to confirm with Google whether compressed native libraries are supported on Android 16 devices with 16kib page size.\r\n\r\n<!--\r\nPlease target the `master` branch in priority.\r\n\r\nRelevant fixes are cherry-picked for stable branches as needed by maintainers.\r\n\r\nTo speed up the contribution process and avoid CI errors, please set up pre-commit hooks locally:\r\nhttps://docs.godotengine.org/en/latest/contributing/development/code_style_guidelines.html\r\n-->\r\n","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https:/